# Keep the build context to what docker/Dockerfile actually COPYs: root
# workspace manifests, packages/*, apps/bridge. Everything below either needs
# a toolchain this image has no reason to carry (Rust/Android for
# apps/mobile), is a pristine subtree mirror never built directly (vendor/),
# is runtime state (data/), or is dependency/VCS churn Docker should never
# need to hash.
.git
vendor/
apps/mobile/
data/
node_modules/
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
**/out/
**/target/
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
